<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-SUNDAY'S PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-SUNDAY'S PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of NBA playoff games on</p>
<p>Sunday (home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>	  Eastern Conference, first round</p>
<p> MIAMI	    91     Orlando	83</p>
<p>(Miami wins best-of-five series 3-2)</p>
<p> ATLANTA	  84     Detroit	79</p>
<p>(Atlanta wins best-of-five series 3-2)</p>
<p>Note: Miami meets New York; Atlanta meets Chicago in</p>
<p>Eastern Conference semifinal series</p>
<p>Western Conference semifinals</p>
<p> UTAH	    93	LA Lakers    77</p>
<p>(Utah leads best-of-seven series 1-0)</p>
</text>
